ineIV","date":". 01-30-2015, 03:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T23:25:07-08:00","id":385920,"title":"","content":"That's the Anthology outline, chief.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-29T23:57:34-08:00","id":385998,"title":"","content":"Since the timing is rather good for this sort of question, I want to ask:<br /> <br /> In a lot of ways, Lily, Sabre, and Thorn feels like a love letter and a goodbye to the first edition of Changeling, or at least to Skemp's helming of the line. While I don't think that it's prelude to an abandonment of that take, it does make me wonder if you and he talked about Changeling's Dark Era in relation to the shift of editions. So, yeah, just curious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-30T00:09:45-08:00","id":386009,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/g225t9mnjcwfsxd/Huntsmen%20Chronicle%20Outline.docx?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/g225t9mnjcwfsxd/Huntsmen%20Chronicle%20Outline.docx?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/g225t9mnjcwfsxd/Huntsmen%20Chronicle%20Outline.docx?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.dropbox.com/s/g225t9mnjcwfsxd/Huntsmen%20Chronicle%20Outline.docx?dl=0 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Fixed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-30T00:11:40-08:00","id":386012,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/385867-changeling-the-lost-second-edition-outline?p=385998#post385998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since the timing is rather good for this sort of question, I want to ask:<br /> <br /> In a lot of ways, Lily, Sabre, and Thorn feels like a love letter and a goodbye to the first edition of Changeling, or at least to Skemp's helming of the line. While I don't think that it's prelude to an abandonment of that take, it does make me wonder if you and he talked about Changeling's Dark Era in relation to the shift of editions. So, yeah, just curious.</div> </div> </div> </div>We didn't actually. At the time, I didn't know I'd be doing Changeling 2.0. I haven't read it yet. Although I did recommend the writer for it, and she's a big part of Changeling 2.0.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-30T00:39:07-08:00","id":386026,"title":"","content":"You might be thinking to yourself, &quot;Arc's probably got a favorite part in the themes or the huntsmen or-&quot;<br /> <br /> NOPE!<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Marianne: I need you to do a system for creating Courts. I need you to work with the people making Courts (WHICH MEANS YOU HAVE TO WORK WITH YOURSELF HA HA HA HA HAH AH AHAHAHSHSHAHSAHA, excuse me.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, that made my day.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-30T00:55:57-08:00","id":386053,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> They can be double-faceted, if you\u2019ve got something weird like a waterbreathing kith. So they could breathe water, AND have something generally useful. </div> </div> </div>...is this my fault for raising a big stink about water-breathing kiths, like, several months ago?<br /> <br /> EDIT:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Miami, Tokyo, Budapest, Capetown, 1,001 Arabian Nights </div> </div> </div>My God, it's full of stars. It's like you cracked open my head and answered all my prayers. Consider this book already purchased. Do we know what city &quot;1,001 Nights&quot; takes place in?","signature":"<hr c